    "updated_at": "2016-01-30T16:29:46Z",
    "body": "Gonna pile some demos from quick googling here. To investigate failures.\n- https://jedidiah.eu/code/css/masks/, the second animated demo works as expected. The first heart mask doesn't -- but it doesn't in Chrome or Safari either.\n- https://css-tricks.com/examples/ImageWipes/ doesn't work in Fx Nightly.\n- http://tympanus.net/codrops/css_reference/mask-image/ half works in Fx Nightly (possibly we don't support gradient masks yet?)\n- http://vanseodesign.com/css/clipping-and-masking-examples/ lots of examples and links to look at here.\n\nhttps://github.com/WebKit/webkit/tree/master/LayoutTests/fast/masking\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
