    "updated_at": "2016-02-04T22:36:49Z",
    "body": "Here's a naive guess at how mapping should happen (I think a few things were left out of the commit at http://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/rev/f6eba571ce59):\n\n| Chrome usage stats | WebKit Mask Property | Standard Equivalent (if any) |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [1.3352%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask) | -webkit-mask | mask |\n| [0.5929%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-box-image) | -webkit-mask-box-image | mask-border :question: |\n| _none_ | _none_ | mask-border-mode |\n| [0.0094%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-box-image-outset) | -webkit-mask-box-image-outset | mask-border-outset :question: |\n| [0.0097%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-box-image-repeat) | -webkit-mask-box-image-repeat | mask-border-repeat :question: |\n| [0.0097%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-box-image-slice) | -webkit-mask-box-image-slice | mask-border-slice :question: |\n| [0.0098%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-box-image-source) | -webkit-mask-box-image-source | mask-border-source :question: |\n| [0.0093%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-box-image-width) | -webkit-mask-box-image-width | mask-border-width :question: |\n| [0.0161%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-clip) | -webkit-mask-clip | mask-clip |\n| [0.0142%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-composite) | -webkit-mask-composite | mask-composite |\n| [4.9836%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-image) | -webkit-mask-image | mask-image |\n| _none_ | _none_ | mask-mode |\n| [0.0093%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-origin) | -webkit-mask-origin | mask-origin |\n| [1.6921%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-position) | -webkit-mask-position | mask-position |\n| [0.0058%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-position-x) | -webkit-mask-position-x | _none_ |\n| [0.0034%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-position-y) | -webkit-mask-position-y | _none_ |\n| [2.0105%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-repeat) | -webkit-mask-repeat | mask-repeat |\n| [<=0.0001%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-repeat-x) | -webkit-mask-repeat-x | _none_ |\n| [<=0.0001%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-repeat-y) | -webkit-mask-repeat-y | _none_ |\n| [2.6887%](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/css/popularity#webkit-mask-size) | -webkit-mask-size | mask-size |\n| none | -webkit-mask-source-type | mask-type |\n\nStuff with :question:  is just a guess, based on naming similarities and descriptions. Need to look more closely.\n\nTODO: Look at props that take keywords and see if values between the two are the same.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
