    "updated_at": "2016-02-04T23:53:09Z",
    "body": "I should probably remove `-webkit-mask-source-type` -- Chrome doesn't support this (WebKit added support shortly after the Blink split). And hopefully when Chrome does add support, they'll just add support for `mask-type` without a prefix.\n\n(Let's keep an eye out for web content that depends on this, but I suspect it would be very, very low).\n",
